# This Vercel project exists only to preview the content marketing page, so
# everything else in the repo is kept out of the deployment.
#
# Code.gs and lead-confirmation-email.gs carry the leads spreadsheet ID and
# must never be served as static files. index.html is the mobile app page,
# which is already live on its own host and posts to the live lead endpoint,
# so it stays out of the preview too.
#
# Patterns follow gitignore rules, so an unanchored name matches at every
# level. /index.html keeps its leading slash on purpose: without it the
# pattern also excludes content-marketing/index.html and the deployment
# has nothing left to serve at the root.

